# Lexify — doimiy kontekst

Yangi chatda foydalanuvchidan GitHub yoki server so‘ralmasin — shu fayl yetarli.

Loyiha: **Lexify**. Mahalliy: `http://localhost:3000`. Production: `https://lexify.zonic.fit`.

## GitHub

- Remote nomi: **manba** (`origin` emas)
- Repo: `git@github.com:Avazov03/TDYU-Live.git`
- Branch: **main**
- Commitga kiritilmasin: `.env`, `.pem`, `.secrets/`

```
git remote add manba git@github.com:Avazov03/TDYU-Live.git
git push -u manba main
```

